{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#card-zh","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 是将 DeepSeek Harness 编码引擎接入现有 Cordis Loader 的插件。它通过 Fiber 管理引擎组合的生命周期，并提供标准、极简、PTC 和 Cordis 等 agent 预置。引擎组合包含原生 agent、持久会话、模型适配器、工具、目标、计划模式、审批与会话存储，并可通过补丁调整组合。标准预置面向日常编码，支持文件与网页检索、Skills、后台任务和子代理；极简预置提供持久 Shell 与编辑工具。适合希望在已有 Cordis 宿主中装配 DSH 服务的开发者；需要兼容的 Node.js 和 Loader 宿主，遥测默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:6-25","src/composition.mjs:10-38","composition/base.patch.yml:15-68","presets/standard/preset.yml:1-3","presets/minimal/preset.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#card-en","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cordis mounts the DSH engine in a Cordis Loader. It provides agents, durable sessions, tools, goals, plan mode, and four presets. Standard mode adds web and filesystem tools, skills, and subagents. Requires Node.js and a Loader; telemetry is off by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:6-25","src/composition.mjs:10-38","composition/base.patch.yml:15-68","presets/standard/preset.yml:1-3","presets/minimal/preset.yml:1-3"]}
