{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#feature-engine","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 的功能「Loader 引擎接入」：插件注入宿主的 loader 服务，把 DSH 组合挂入现有树，并由 Fiber 持有；移除 Loader 行时可以撤下该引擎服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:6-25"]}
{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#feature-presets","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 的功能「Agent 预置」：组合默认加入标准、极简、PTC 与 Cordis 创作预置，供宿主按配置选择不同编码 Agent 和工具集合。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/composition.mjs:15-23"]}
{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#feature-sessions","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 的功能「持久会话」：基础组合装载 JSONL 会话持久化与本地存储服务，并为会话列表维护投影缓存，让 DSH 会话可保存并恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["composition/base.patch.yml:110-166"]}
{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#feature-tools","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 的功能「编码工具组合」：基础服务装载文件系统、Shell、网页检索与抓取、Skills、目标和子代理等工具能力，Agent 可在编码过程中调用这些服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["composition/base.patch.yml:243-340"]}
{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#feature-plan","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 的功能「计划与上下文管理」：组合提供计划模式、会话压缩和工具结果裁剪等服务，用于先规划任务并控制较长会话的上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["composition/base.patch.yml:354-420"]}
{"unit_id":"cordisplugins__dsh-cordis#caveat-telemetry","repo":"cordisplugins/dsh-cordis","commit":"eaa316ec6bc962396397892bacf24391c1a528c5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cordis 使用前须知：遥测开关默认关闭；启用后默认采用反馈模式，并将日志发往 DeepSeek 遥测端点，可用环境变量覆盖地址。（见 composition/base.patch.yml:168-191）","source":"generated","evidence":["composition/base.patch.yml:168-191","src/index.mjs:8-14"]}
